        <h2 class="ct-heading font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-8">Begin with a conversation</h2>
        <div class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed space-y-6 mb-8">
          <p>A free 15-minute fit call is a chance to ask questions, discuss what you are looking for, and see whether it makes sense to work together. There is no obligation to continue.</p>
          <p class="text-base">The calendar is for that introductory call. In-person counselling appointments are arranged afterwards, with the location details shared privately.</p>
